<h2 style='color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>Payment reminder: invoice {{invoiceNumber}}</h2>
<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>Hello,</p>
<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>The invoice for the charging sessions of <strong>{{fleetName}}</strong> in {{periodLabel}} was due on {{dueAt}} and is not paid yet. The invoice is attached again as a PDF.</p>
<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>
  <tr><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#6b7280;'>Invoice</td><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:right;'>{{invoiceNumber}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#6b7280;'>Period</td><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:right;'>{{periodLabel}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#6b7280;'>Issued</td><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:right;'>{{issuedAt}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#6b7280;'>Due</td><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:right;'>{{dueAt}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#1a1a1a;'><strong>Amount due</strong></td><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:right;'><strong>{{total}}</strong></td></tr>
</table>
<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>Please pay the amount now. If you have already paid, please disregard this reminder.</p>
